UES_ASCII_COMPLETOS_SESION.txt).\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Findings\n1. **Why `U-Boot 2015.01-g220e992 (Sep 05 2023)` (`SN=Z41220090388172`) Did NOT Enter `InUsbBurn` (`VID_1B8E`) When Holding `RESET`:**\n   - In [`BLOQUES_ASCII_COMPLETOS_SESION.txt`](file:///c:/Users/andre/OneDrive/Desktop/xview/experimento/14_MONITOREO_EN_VIVO_SMARTTY/BLOQUES_ASCII_COMPLETOS_SESION.txt) (lines 4587–4596), when `GPIOAO_3 (gpio 3) value is 0` (`detect upgrade key`) on the Sep 05 2023 U-Boot (`2015.01-g220e992`), U-Boot executes `itest ${upgrade_key_flag} == 0`. Because `upgrade_key_flag` is undefined in `env`, `itest` fails with `Usage: itest [.b, .w, .l, .s] [*]value1 <op> [*]value2` and skips `run update` (`InUsbBurn`)! Instead, the Linux kernel boots and `gpio_keypad_down_cnt: 60` reboots into Recovery (or `fastbootd` `PID_4EE7` when `factory_update_param.aml` has `--fastboot`).\n   - Additionally, in `StartDedicatedWorldCupHuntFromLockedFastboot`, `fastboot reboot` was fired 0.08s after pressing `1` on the PC keyboard without a countdown, and the 40s loop only checked `VID_1B8E` without checking if the box booted into `PID_4EE7`, `PID_4EE2`, or `PID_4EE1`.\n2. **What Makes Up the \"Interfaz del Firmware del Xview Liberado\" (`DMC.v2.25` / `ViettelBox_B866V2`):**\n   - From [`ANALISIS_REA_XUPER_Y_FIRMWARE_XVIEW.md`](file:///c:/Users/andre/OneDrive/Desktop/xview/ANALISIS_REA_XUPER_Y_FIRMWARE_XVIEW.md) and [`experimento/01_info_sistema/paquetes_instalados.txt`](file:///c:/Users/andre/OneDrive/Desktop/xview/experimento/01_info_sistema/paquetes_instalados.txt):\n     - Because `super.img` (>100 MB) was excluded by `.gitignore` and is not present on disk, flashing the 12 partition images (`boot.img`, `dtb.img`, `dtbo.img`, `logo.img`, `oem.img`, `param.img`, `conf.img`, `vbmeta.img`, `recovery.img`, `cache_ext4.img`, `bootloader.img`, `env_unlocked.img`) alone does not replace `/system` or `/product` inside `super`.\n     - To achieve the exact **Liberated Xview Firmware Interface** (`DMC.v2.25` / Android TV), the program must:\n       1. Copy the remaining extracted APKs from [`experimento/04_apks_dispositivo/`](file:///c:/Users/andre/OneDrive/Desktop/xview/experimento/04_apks_dispositivo) into [`programa perfecto/2_APKS_LIBERACION_Y_TV/`](file:///c:/Users/andre/OneDrive/Desktop/xview/programa%20perfecto/2_APKS_LIBERACION_Y_TV):\n          - [`com.google.android.tvlauncher.apk`](file:///c:/Users/andre/OneDrive/Desktop/xview/experimento/04_apks_dispositivo/com.google.android.tvlauncher.apk) (`13.55 MB` — Official Google Android TV Launcher from the liberated Xview firmware)\n          - [`tv.mxlmovies.app.apk`](file:///c:/Users/andre/OneDrive/Desktop/xview/experimento/04_apks_dispositivo/tv.mxlmovies.app.apk) (`40.37 MB` — MXL Movies from the liberated Xview firmware)\n          - [`com.xuper.netxxus.apk`](file:///c:/Users/andre/OneDrive/Desktop/xview/experimento/04_apks_dispositivo/com.xuper.netxxus.apk) (`34.43 MB` — XSairec TV from the liberated Xview firmware, alongside `xuper_hydra.apk`)\n          - [`ControlDevice.apk`](file:///c:/Users/andre/OneDrive/Desktop/xview/experimento/04_apks_dispositivo/ControlDevice.apk) (`17.87 MB` — `com.control.device` / `Khiv` Settings from the liberated Xview firmware)\n       2. In the liberation & firmware injection flow (both via USB/Network ADB and via USB Drive `KINGSTON` + `Fastboot`), install the complete Liberated Xview Firmware UI suite (`com.google.android.tvlauncher.apk`, `TVLauncher_4_GoogleTV.apk`, `Home_Screen_Launcher_1.1.3.apk`, `AppDMC.apk`, `DLStore.apk`, `Hdplay.apk`, `Filemanager.apk`, `xuper_hydra.apk`, `com.xuper.netxxus.apk`, `tv.mxlmovies.app.apk`, `signMagisTV_APS-MUTO.apk`, `Downloader_2.0.4.apk`, `Button_Mapper_Pro_2.54.apk`, `autostart.apk`), disable Play Protect, disable/uninstall all Megacable lock/launcher packages (`com.dotscreen.megacable.atv`, `com.dotscreen.megacable.core`, `com.dotscreen.megacable.portal`, `com.dotscreen.megacable.updater`, `com.dotscreen.megacable.livetv`, `